{"translation":{"id":"pan_irv","name":"ਇੰਡਿਅਨ ਰਿਵਾਇਜ਼ਡ ਵਰਜ਼ਨ (IRV) - ਪੰਜਾਬੀ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=pan","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=pan","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"IRV","englishName":"Punjabi Indian Revised Version Bible","language":"pan","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"7bcf70d369a169a12ac867ce44def25b36147b72029339f8c8d3c7a06bab588d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31104,"languageName":"ਪੰਜਾਬੀ","languageEnglishName":"Punjabi"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"pan_irv","name":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","commonName":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","title":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"8a1b7c5c3025a80671b87659256d14a42fb58ace987b687a83db2b26ac8a5d95","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":128,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ਪਰਮੇਸ਼ੁਰ ਦਾ ਡਰ ਮੰਨਣ ਦੀ ਬਰਕਤ"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["ਯਾਤਰਾ ਦਾ ਗੀਤ"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ਧੰਨ ਹੈ ਹਰੇਕ ਜੋ ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਦਾ ਭੈਅ ਮੰਨਦਾ ਹੈ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਅਤੇ ਉਸ ਦੇ ਰਾਹਾਂ ਉੱਤੇ ਚੱਲਦਾ ਹੈ!","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਤੂੰ ਆਪਣੇ ਹੱਥਾਂ ਦੀ ਕਮਾਈ ਜ਼ਰੂਰ ਖਾਵੇਂਗਾ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਤੂੰ ਧੰਨ ਹੋਵੇਂਗਾ ਅਤੇ ਤੇਰਾ ਭਲਾ ਹੋਵੇਗਾ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਤੇਰੀ ਵਹੁਟੀ ਫਲਦਾਰ ਦਾਖ ਵਾਂਗੂੰ ਤੇਰੇ ਘਰ ਦੇ ਅੰਦਰ ਹੋਵੇਗੀ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਤੇਰੇ ਬੱਚੇ ਜ਼ੈਤੂਨ ਦੇ ਬੂਟਿਆਂ ਵਾਂਗੂੰ ਤੇਰੀ ਮੇਜ਼ ਦੇ ਆਲੇ-ਦੁਆਲੇ ਹੋਣਗੇ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਵੇਖੋ, ਉਹ ਮਨੁੱਖ ਮੁਬਾਰਕ ਹੋਵੇਗਾ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਜਿਹੜਾ ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਦਾ ਭੈਅ ਮੰਨਦਾ ਹੈ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਸੀਯੋਨ ਤੋਂ ਤੈਨੂੰ ਬਰਕਤ ਦੇਵੇ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਅਤੇ ਤੂੰ ਜੀਵਨ ਭਰ ਯਰੂਸ਼ਲਮ ਦੀ ਭਲਿਆਈ ਵੇਖੇਂ,","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਸਗੋਂ ਤੂੰ ਆਪਣੇ ਦੋਹਤ੍ਰੇ-ਪੋਤ੍ਰੇ ਵੇਖੇਂ!","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਇਸਰਾਏਲ ਉੱਤੇ ਸਲਾਮਤੀ ਹੋਵੇ।","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/128.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/129.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/127.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":6}